# UX workflow: Track bottom-left mute/remove actions.
# Purpose: validates Track focus and Track selection share the same model:
# tap toggles mute without deleting content; hold removes selected tracks.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen track_focus_initial

# Create a second track so mute and remove can be distinguished.
150 encoder NAV 1
350 capture screen track_2_add_preview
450 tap NAV 60
700 capture screen track_2_created

# Track focus: tap toggles mute, a second tap toggles it back.
800 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
1050 capture screen track_2_muted_by_tap
1150 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
1400 capture screen track_2_unmuted_by_tap

# Track selection: select focused track, tap toggles mute, hold removes it.
1500 button NAV down
2600 tick
2650 capture screen track_selection_entered
2700 button NAV up
2800 tap NAV 60
3050 capture screen track_2_selected
3150 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
3400 capture screen track_selection_muted_by_tap
3500 tap BOTTOM_LEFT 60
3750 capture screen track_selection_unmuted_by_tap
3850 button BOTTOM_LEFT down
4900 tick
4950 capture screen track_selection_remove_hold_applied
5000 button BOTTOM_LEFT up
5250 capture screen track_selection_removed
